{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コートを着ても寒すぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お布団をカラダに巻いて外にでかけたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いときに電車に乗ると幸せって思います。⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなるとなんか寂しくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーの匂いに飽きてきちゃって、そろそろ新しいのにかえたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめの頃はいい匂いでも、慣れちゃうと飽きてきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探しにいこっと。ベリを連れて( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香りが続くシャンプー何かないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーの香りはやっぱり落ち着きます⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプー探しの旅にでる⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車に乗りたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前は行く場所も決めてなかったけど、自転車に乗りたくて、たくさん自転車をこいでました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車に乗って海まで行ったりしてみたかったな⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にスタートして、夜明けに着くみたいな。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZXPB1EXZV3A2ASFESSMKE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまごぼーろがたべたい。\nたまごぼーろだっけ。?まるこぼーろ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}